English, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Dutch, Greek,
Russian, Arabic, Hindi, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese,
Japanese and Korean. Exact files, byte sizes, Git blobs and SHA-256
checksums are in catalog.json at this fixed source revision.
The accompanying LICENSE is the original tessdata_fast Apache-2.0 license.

The worker and all matching core variants are copied from integrity-pinned npm
packages during preparation. All committed models and fonts are
checksum-verified before copying. Selected models are verified again at
initialization and passed as bytes to the single owned worker. No OCR asset
is downloaded at application runtime. Cache/CDN fallback is disabled.
Only horizontal printed layout is supported; vertical sublanguages, osd and
arbitrary language filenames are not loaded.

